       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CMEF-DSD-EXTENDED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CMEF-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FOURIER-PERIODIC-BIAS-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LOWFREQ-LR-DAMPING-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-JENSEN-SHANNON-DIV-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HIERARCHY-SUB-LINEAR-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-SCALE-HEATMAP-ASYM PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CMEF-EXT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-EXTENDED-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-EXTENDED-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-INDUCTIVE-BIASES.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DIVERSITY-AND-SCALING.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-HEATMAP-ASYMMETRY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-INDUCTIVE-BIASES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FOURIER-PERIODIC-BIAS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LOWFREQ-LR-DAMPING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DIVERSITY-AND-SCALING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-JENSEN-SHANNON-DIV-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HIERARCHY-SUB-LINEAR-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-HEATMAP-ASYMMETRY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-SCALE-HEATMAP-ASYM.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FOURIER-PERIODIC-BIAS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LOWFREQ-LR-DAMPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-JENSEN-SHANNON-DIV-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HIERARCHY-SUB-LINEAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-SCALE-HEATMAP-ASYM = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-EXTENDED-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-EXTENDED-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-EXTENDED-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-EXTENDED-CODE.
